# Superdesign working state: keep scratch HTML out of git, but version the
# durable artifacts a human or a later session needs (design contract, repo
# context, resume state). The CLI may rewrite `.superdesign/*` on its own runs;
# restore these negations if it does.
.superdesign/*
!.superdesign/design-system.md
!.superdesign/resume.json
!.superdesign/init/
!.superdesign/init/**

# Recorded image refs for scripts/self-update.sh (per-host state, never committed).
.deploy/
